\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This repository contains the R code used for the paper 
\f0\b \'93Approximate exchange and block pseudo-posterior algorithms for spatio-temporal hidden Markov models\'94
\f1\b0  by D. Tancini (University of Perugia, Italy), R. Rastelli (University College Dublin, Ireland), and F. Bartolucci (University of Perugia, Italy).\
The repository is organized into 11 folders, corresponding to the 9 simulation scenarios (A\'96I), the real-data application, and the generation of plots.\
Each simulation scenario folder contains the following R scripts:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Latent process simulator
\f1\b0  (
\fs26 U_sim_phase_transition_speed.R
\fs24 ): simulates the latent process.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Auxiliary process simulator
\f1\b0  (
\fs26 Omega_sampler_general_model_speed.R
\fs24 ): generates auxiliary samples required by the algorithms.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Approximate exchange algorithm
\f1\b0 : implements the approximate exchange algorithm.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pseudo-posterior algorithm
\f1\b0  (
\fs26 pseudo
\fs24 ): implements the pseudo-posterior algorithm.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Block pseudo-posterior algorithm
\f1\b0  (
\fs26 pseudo_block
\fs24 ): implements the block pseudo-posterior algorithm.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Performance measures
\f1\b0  (
\fs26 MAE.R
\fs24 ): computes the mean absolute error and root mean squared error  for the corresponding scenario.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 In addition, the folder for 
\f0\b Scenario G
\f1\b0  includes the script 
\fs26 Sim_exact_k2_n4_T2.R
\fs24 , which implements the exact algorithm for posterior inference and provides a benchmark for comparison with the approximate methods.\
The remaining folders contain the code for the real-data application and for generating the plots presented in the paper.\
